      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Maria Rodriguez, Director of Research at Hospital del Mar, speaks highly of Dr. Toshiro Shinke's contributions and dedication to the institution."</data>
      <data key="d5">"recognition, leadership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0271</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DR. TOSHIRO SHINKE&quot;" target="&quot;DR. JUAN SANCHEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Juan Sanchez, a colleague and co-author of Dr. Toshiro Shinke, praises his attention to detail and innovative approach to problem-solving."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaboration, innovation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0271</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;HOSPITAL DEL MAR&quot;" target="&quot;KOBE UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both hospitals have a professional connection through Dr. Toshiro Shinke, who has contributed to research projects and received funding from the same sources."</data>
      <data key="d5">"professional connection, research collaboration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0271</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KOBE UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;JAPANESE MINISTRY OF EDUCATION, CULTURE, SPORTS, SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Kobe University Hospital has received funding from the Japanese Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology, which has also supported Dr. Toshiro Shinke's research projects."</data>
      <data key="d5">"funding, research support"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0271</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KOBE UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL&quot;" target="&quot;DR. HIROSHI MATSUMOTO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Hiroshi Matsumoto is the Director of Kobe University Hospital, indicating his leadership role within the organization."</data>
      <data key="d5">"leadership, affiliation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0271</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DR. HIROSHI MATSUMOTO&quot;" target="&quot;JOURNAL OF CARDIOVASCULAR MEDICINE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Hiroshi Matsumoto is associated with the Journal of Cardiovascular Medicine as a source, suggesting his involvement in or contribution to the field of cardiovascular medicine."</data>
      <data key="d5">"publication, expertise"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0271</data>
